{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Star Garden",
    "steam_appid": 3370970,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/3b42b004dd43e4a30c6446e886e8a52e.avif?t=1755031154\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Star Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey where you\u2019ll team up with powerful creatures called Lumi to uncover the secrets of a mysterious world waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo and Lyra, cosmic ecologists on a mission to study new ecosystems, find themselves stranded on Solaris, a vibrant and uncharted planet filled with incredible life forms. Their crash landing leads to an extraordinary encounter with the Lumi, unique creatures whose abilities may hold the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, customize, and evolve your Lumi to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Venture Fields teeming with Lumi villages, hidden areas, and untold secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mysteries of Solaris.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return to the stars, or will Solaris change your path forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.avif?t=1755031154\" data-has-big width=1600 height=985 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer Battle Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and others in CosmiClash, where quick thinking and strategy lead to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or up to six online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a base Lumi, collect items to boost its abilities, and outsmart your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable events that keep every match fresh and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in this competitive multiplayer mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.avif?t=1755031154\" data-has-big width=1600 height=972 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/3b42b004dd43e4a30c6446e886e8a52e.avif?t=1755031154\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Star Garden!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an unforgettable journey where you\u2019ll team up with powerful creatures called Lumi to uncover the secrets of a mysterious world waiting to be discovered.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leo and Lyra, cosmic ecologists on a mission to study new ecosystems, find themselves stranded on Solaris, a vibrant and uncharted planet filled with incredible life forms. Their crash landing leads to an extraordinary encounter with the Lumi, unique creatures whose abilities may hold the key to survival.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise, customize, and evolve your Lumi to unlock their full potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Venture Fields teeming with Lumi villages, hidden areas, and untold secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the mysteries of Solaris.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you return to the stars, or will Solaris change your path forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/62ef38b6510ebf390b836259dc55d50e.avif?t=1755031154\" data-has-big width=1600 height=985 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local &amp; Online Multiplayer Battle Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself and others in CosmiClash, where quick thinking and strategy lead to victory!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players locally or up to six online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a base Lumi, collect items to boost its abilities, and outsmart your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable events that keep every match fresh and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove your skills in this competitive multiplayer mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370970/extras/89d92d8d6833f3ad05c967569b525c54.avif?t=1755031154\" data-has-big width=1600 height=972 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Raise cosmic pets that transform and evolve into the vehicles you ride! Explore a single-player Story Mode or battle rivals in local and online matches with up to four players locally or six online. Your interstellar adventure awaits!",
